pattern	arms	default	engine_dfa
\w++\b	off	vm	refused: pcrec: possessive quantifier requires the VM engine, which --engine=df
\w++\b	on	dfa	compiled
(?>\w+)\b	off	vm	refused: pcrec: (?>...) requires the VM engine, which --engine=dfa excludes (pa
(?>\w+)\b	on	dfa	compiled
x(?>\w+)\b	off	vm	refused: pcrec: (?>...) requires the VM engine, which --engine=dfa excludes (pa
x(?>\w+)\b	on	dfa	compiled
\d++(?![\d.])	off	vm	refused: pcrec: possessive quantifier requires the VM engine, which --engine=df
\d++(?![\d.])	on	dfa	compiled
[a-z]++(?=@)	off	vm	refused: pcrec: possessive quantifier requires the VM engine, which --engine=df
[a-z]++(?=@)	on	dfa	compiled
(?>[a-z]+)(?=@)	off	vm	refused: pcrec: (?>...) requires the VM engine, which --engine=dfa excludes (pa
(?>[a-z]+)(?=@)	on	dfa	compiled
